MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Aur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Aur_m01_001: Cai, your eyes are wonderful. They look just like\nmy mother's.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Aur_m01_002: I'm a little envious. I never liked my own eye color all\nthat much.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Aur_m01_003: Oh, never mind all that now. How is your left hand?\nHas anything unusual happened with it lately?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Aur_m01_004: If there haven't been any particular changes, then\nmaybe now is a good time...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Aur_m01_005: I'd love for you to tell me all about your life in\nthe village.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Aur_m01_006: Did Castor look after you as a father should?\nWere you properly fed every day?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Aur_m01_007: So in my place, Peter's mother cared for you.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Aur_m01_008: Did you know Estie used to be a vulkan in this\ntemple? She was actually your father's senior.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Aur_m01_009: I'm so glad that Estie was there for you both. I really\nmust send her my thanks.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c07_Aur_m01: <BLN>Your eyes...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Hur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Hur_m01_001: I collected the documents Aurora requested.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Hur_m01_002: It took a little while to do. You ought to see how\nmany books the temple has!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Hur_m01_007: <NCA>Show concern.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Hur_m01_008: <NCB>Suggest she take a break.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Hur_m01_003: <ACA>Are you asking if I'm OK? I'm fine!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Hur_m01_004: <ACB>Thank you, Cai. But, I have to do what Aurora needs\nme to.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Hur_m01_005: Aurora seems like she's had a lot of things on\nher mind lately.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Hur_m01_006: Not like she's distracted or anything, it's just...\nHmmm...
MID_LGA_1KAI_c07_Hur_m01: <BLN>Took a little while...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Tia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Tia_m01_001: I've been thinking about what your mom said.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Tia_m01_002: If the jewel in your left hand truly is Balor's eye...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Tia_m01_003: Then maybe all of Drake's treasures are similar.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Tia_m01_04: You said the queen of Saramis had the same power\nin her right arm. If that's the case, then maybe...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Tia_m01_005: You know, it's probably best we keep this quiet.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c07_Tia_m01: <BLN>I can't stop thinking about it...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Pet_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Pet_m01_001: We've seen lots of scary stuff lately.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Pet_m01_002: But that's helped me realize something important.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Pet_m01_003: In the Heroic Games, we're facing off against other\nhumans. That's way easier than our other fights.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Pet_m01_005: Huh? You don't think that's it? So then, what, I just\ngot braver?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Pet_m01_006: Well, if that's the case, then that's pretty great.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c07_Pet_m01: <BLN>Lots of scary stuff lately...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cas_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cas_m01_001: Hey, Cai, I— What's up with your eyes?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cas_m01_002: They're the same color as that jewel in your hand.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cas_m01_003: They changed like that on your trip?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cas_m01_004: I don't understand much about it all. But Balor's\nblood does run through your veins.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cas_m01_005: Everything else is fine? Other than your eye color\nchanging, I mean.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cas_m01_006: <NCA>Confirm it.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cas_m01_007: <NCB>Say you're not sure yet.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cas_m01_008: <ACA>I see. Well, that's good...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cas_m01_009: If you notice anything strange, be sure to bring it up\nwith your mom right away, got me?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c07_Cas_m01: <BLN>Let me get a look at you...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cen_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cen_m01_001: The ruined kingdom of Damascar... Yu Phas's\ntemple...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cen_m01_002: Cybele is full of the empire's most sinister history.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cen_m01_003: Entry to this land has always been forbidden.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cen_m01_004: I assumed it was by the will of the Divine Sovereign\nand never doubted it to any great degree.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cen_m01_005: Now, though, I see that something truly terrifying\ndoes indeed lurk there.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c07_Cen_m01_006: Cai, I think it would be best if you kept away.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c07_Cen_m01: <BLN>Something truly terrifying...